# Integration Test Cases - Movie Recommendation API

## Authentication Flow Integration

1. Test complete Google OAuth flow from start to finish
2. Test failed OAuth login redirects correctly
3. Test session persists across multiple requests
4. Test logout completely clears session data

## API Endpoint Integration

1. Test all movie endpoints respond correctly together
2. Test data consistency across multiple endpoints
3. Test response time is acceptable under load
4. Test concurrent requests are handled properly
5. Test error responses are consistent across endpoints

## Database Integration

1. Test PostgreSQL connection establishes successfully
2. Test user data is retrieved correctly from database
3. Test database queries execute within performance limits
4. Test database errors are handled properly
5. Test connection pooling works with multiple connections

## Middleware Integration

1. Test CORS allows valid origins
2. Test CORS blocks invalid origins
3. Test session middleware creates sessions correctly
4. Test passport serializes and deserializes users
5. Test Swagger documentation loads with routes

## End-to-End User Flows

1. Test complete flow: login, browse movies, logout
2. Test carousel data displays with filter applied
3. Test search returns accurate movie results
4. Test API documentation is accessible and functional

